{"id":"150af883bccb8887","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-phi-e.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine Encoding","display":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-phi-e","aliases":["57-df-phi-e","df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding"],"display":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]","[[57-df-minimum-operator]]","[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]","[[57-df-halt-notation]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-program-numbering]]","[[57-df-t-predicate]]","[[57-df-machine-coding]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-phi-e"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-phi-e</span><span>df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"446d13f76de9da28\" href=\"?note=446d13f76de9da28\" title=\"57-df-normal-form-theorem\">57-df-normal-form-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" href=\"?note=a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" title=\"57-df-minimum-operator\">57-df-minimum-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"998fef6bee8f7a88\" href=\"?note=998fef6bee8f7a88\" title=\"57-df-min-operator-generalized\">57-df-min-operator-generalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad4b08ee803904de\" href=\"?note=ad4b08ee803904de\" title=\"57-df-halt-notation\">57-df-halt-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6cf31091f58bf0b5\" href=\"?note=6cf31091f58bf0b5\" title=\"57-df-program-numbering\">57-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" href=\"?note=5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" title=\"57-df-t-predicate\">57-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9c9625457efede7\" href=\"?note=b9c9625457efede7\" title=\"57-df-machine-coding\">57-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-phi-e-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-Index-Function\">df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Index Function</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in D_n\">\\(\\vec x\\in D_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6cf31091f58bf0b5\" href=\"?note=6cf31091f58bf0b5\" title=\"57-df-program-numbering\">57-df-program-numbering</a> 的程序编号、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" href=\"?note=5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" title=\"57-df-t-predicate\">57-df-t-predicate</a> 的实际停机历史关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b9c9625457efede7\" href=\"?note=b9c9625457efede7\" title=\"57-df-machine-coding\">57-df-machine-coding</a> 的总输出提取函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；不更换编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a>，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"446d13f76de9da28\" href=\"?note=446d13f76de9da28\" title=\"57-df-normal-form-theorem\">57-df-normal-form-theorem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\)</span> 为部分函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"ad4b08ee803904de\" href=\"?note=ad4b08ee803904de\" title=\"57-df-halt-notation\">57-df-halt-notation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\">\\(\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\)</span> 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" href=\"?note=a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" title=\"57-df-minimum-operator\">57-df-minimum-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"998fef6bee8f7a88\" href=\"?note=998fef6bee8f7a88\" title=\"57-df-min-operator-generalized\">57-df-min-operator-generalized</a>。</p>\n<p>旧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi_e(\\vec x)\\)</span> 元组调用仍保留为下式的元数重载；它不是把元组当作一个自然数编码后调用一元函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in D_n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land U(s)=z)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e^{(1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in D_n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land U(s)=z)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e^{(1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})=\\{\\vec x\\in D_n:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})=\\{\\vec x\\in D_n:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)}),\\qquad\n\\varphi_e(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\\quad(n&gt;1,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)}),\\qquad\n\\varphi_e(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\\quad(n&gt;1,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\left[\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\coloneqq\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\left[\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\coloneqq\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)=U\\!\\left(\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)=U\\!\\left(\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(n)}:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PRF}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(n)}:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PRF}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\n\\quad(n\\ge1,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\n\\quad(n\\ge1,\\ \\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留部分函数图、φₑ、φₑ⁽ⁿ⁾、Wₑ 和 PRF_n 的接口。数值一元域 D₁=ℕ 明确给出；多元调用是元数重载，而不是把多元元组当作一元输入的自然数编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-phi-e-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-Index-Function","text":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Index Function","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-normal-form-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-minimum-operator","status":"resolved","id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-minimum-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-min-operator-generalized","status":"resolved","id":"998fef6bee8f7a88","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-halt-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ad4b08ee803904de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-halt-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"6cf31091f58bf0b5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-machine-coding","status":